= The Typst Playground

Welcome to the Typst Playground! This is a sandbox where you can experiment
with Typst. The preview updates while you edit the source.

= Basics <basics>

Typst is a _markup_ language. You use it to express the content, structure, and
formatting of a document. For example, surrounding a word with underscores
_emphasizes_ it, while an equals sign at the beginning of a line creates a
heading.

- *Strongly emphasize* some text
- Refer to @basics
- Typeset math: $a, b in {1/2, sqrt(4 a b)}$

